{"version":1,"content":"<p>金馬影后舒淇演而優則導，首部自編自導電影《女孩》奪得第63屆金馬獎「最佳新導演」，她現身慶功宴，直言從李安與韓國名導奉俊昊手中接過獎座，那一刻「非常夢幻」，並透露李安給了她大大的擁抱，她甜笑說：「我人緣還不錯，大家都替我開心」。</p><p>&lt;br</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:12:29.025072+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T08:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T08:05:51.672757+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:05:51.672757+00:00","content_hash":"a99930ec9d0734e30bf90d1f8e2136dedcabd885d077d2999d8476c61270bb9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}